--
libc++ (LLVM 18) std::__bind_back (the core of std::views::take).  Checking
tuple's constructor constraints used to instantiate the definition of a
constexpr constructor template, and through it two __tuple_impl bodies
(tuple:488) that are ill-formed for those arguments and were dropped
(cpp11_tuple_converting_constructor_spurious_instantiation).
